## Description

Nice! We no longer need a depth sensor, a Kinect, or even Windows to build amazing interactive installations.  Just an Apple device, ARKit, and AI.  Rendered with Three.js in Electron, using its new SharedTexture API for direct GPU-to-GPU texture sharing. 🚀 https://t.co/2U3cxDGoLd

